# The A320 round the CBD at 147 kt, its approach speed: a flaps-down figure.
# Flown clean, as a plan is, she comes down 500 ft before she reaches the
# circle, so the plan is refused as it is read (assets/figures/a320.xml,
# <plan_speeds>).
aircraft a320
start -33.95 151.2093 3000 0 147
orbit CBD -33.8688 151.2093 3200 3000 147 2 left
